    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Updated: 2020-02-11\r\n\r\nThis directory contains raw data used in Jennings et al., 2020, Participatory science for coastal water quality: freshwater plume mapping and volunteer retention in a randomized informational intervention\r\n\r\nCurrently, some analyses of survey data cannot be completed with these published data because they are de-identified and lack proper linking keys.\r\n\r\nSome data are not included:\r\nIdentifiable participant information.\r\nSalary information not used in analysis.\r\nPreliminary participant surveys to arrange training sessions.\r\nScript for pulling Mail Chimp data.\r\nMail Chimp member ID key.\r\nPlanet Labs satellite imagery used with permission under California educator's license.\r\nScripts used to analyze these data.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Jennings, W.C., S. Cunniff, K. Lewis, H. Deres, D. R. Reineman, J. Davis, A. B. Boehm. 2020. Raw data for \"Participatory science for coastal water quality: freshwater plume mapping and volunteer retention in a randomized informational intervention\". Stanford Digital Repository. https://purl.stanford.edu/pb938sy7980",
            "type": "preferred citation",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
    ],
